<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Panic News - Breaking Health Crisis Alerts</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #1a1a1a;
            color: #fff;
        }
        .header {
            background-color: #333;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .main {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .article {
            background-color: #2d2d2d;
            padding: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            border-radius: 5px;
        }
        .quote {
            font-style: italic;
            color: #888;
        }
        .disclaimer {
            color: #666;
            font-size: 0.9em;
            text-align: center;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header class="header">
        <h1>Panic News</h1>
        <p>A Trusted Source for Breaking Health Crisis Information</p>
    </header>

    <main class="main">
        <article class="article">
            <h2>Breaking: New Deadly Virus Outbreak Identified</h2>
            <p>Scientists have discovered a highly contagious virus with no known cure, spreading rapidly across the globe. Symptoms include severe respiratory issues and altered mental state.</p>
            <div class="quote">"This is the worst health crisis since the Black Death. People need to take immediate action." - Dr. Richard Carter, CDC</div>
        </article>

        <article class="article">
            <h2>Confirmed: Transmission Through Touching Surfaces</h2>
            <p>Latest studies reveal the virus can survive on surfaces for up to 48 hours. Simple handwashing may not be enough to prevent infection.</p>
            <div class="quote">"The virus is airborne and more dangerous than initially thought." - Dr. Emily Lee, WHO</div>
        </article>

        <article class="article">
            <h2>Global Stock Markets Crash Amidst Pandemic Fears</h2>
            <p>Financial markets have plummeted as investors fear the economic impact of the virus outbreak. Experts warn of a global recession.</p>
            <div class="quote">"This will be the end of modern society as we know it." - Financial Analyst John Smith</div>
        </article>

        <div class="disclaimer">
            <p>*Note: This website is a satirical hoax. There is no real virus. Please stay calm and informed.</p>
        </div>
    </main>

    <script>
        // Simple JavaScript for interactivity, e.g., countdown timer
        function updateClock() {
            const now = new Date();
            const year = now.getFullYear();
            const month = now.getMonth() + 1;
            const day = now.getDate();
            const hour = now.getHours();
            const minute = now.getMinutes();
            const second = now.getSeconds();
            document.getElementById('clock').innerHTML = `${year}-${month}-${day} ${hour}:${minute}:${second}`;
        }
        setInterval(updateClock, 1000);
    </script>
</body>
</html>
```

